[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=More software
Name[it]=Altro software
Name[fr]=Autres logiciels
Name[de]=Weitere Software
Name[es]=Más software
Comment=AstroArch · install or remove astronomy programs
Comment[it]=AstroArch · installa o rimuovi programmi per l'astronomia
Comment[fr]=AstroArch · installer ou supprimer des logiciels d'astronomie
Comment[de]=AstroArch · Astronomie-Programme installieren oder entfernen
Comment[es]=AstroArch · instala o quita programas de astronomía
Exec=astroarch-control-center --page software --single
Icon=org.astroarch.software-installer
Categories=System;Settings;
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=true
StartupWMClass=org.astroarch.software-installer
# One page of the AstroArch Control Center, in its own small window
